== How do I change my username? ==

This can only be done by an admin, please [[http://surfguitar101.com/contact/|contact us]] for assistance. '''This should only be done very rarely, if at all'''. Please note that this is much preferable to creating a new account, as all your forum posts, badges, and comments will follow your new username. Creating a new account starts you over at zero, and you'll have to build up trust within the community again. Creating a new account also clutters up the database and you run the risk of using two accounts at the same time, which is in violation of the site rules.
